signal-port-name-pressed = 按下
signal-port-description-pressed = 每当发射器激活时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-on-transmitter = 开启
signal-port-description-on-transmitter = 每当发射器开启时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-off-transmitter = 关闭
signal-port-description-off-transmitter = 每当发射器关闭时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-status-transmitter = 状态
signal-port-description-status-transmitter = 根据发射器状态以 HIGH 或 LOW 调用此端口。

signal-port-name-left = 左
signal-port-description-left = 每当拉杆移至最左位置时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-right = 右
signal-port-description-right = 每当拉杆移至最右位置时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-doorstatus = 门状态
signal-port-description-doorstatus = 门打开时以 HIGH 调用此端口，门完全关闭时以 LOW 调用。

signal-port-name-dockstatus = 对接状态
signal-port-description-dockstatus = 对接时以 HIGH 调用此端口，解除对接时以 LOW 调用。

signal-port-name-middle = 中间
signal-port-description-middle = 每当拉杆移至中间位置时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-trigger-sender = 触发
signal-port-description-trigger-sender = 每当设备触发时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-timer-trigger = 计时器
signal-port-description-timer-trigger = 每当计时结束时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-timer-start = 计时器启动
signal-port-description-timer-start = 每当计时器启动时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-logic-output = 输出
signal-port-description-logic-output = 根据所选逻辑门和输入以 HIGH 或 LOW 调用此端口。

signal-port-name-logic-output-high = 高电平输出
signal-port-description-logic-output-high = 每当输入出现上升沿时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-logic-output-low = 低电平输出
signal-port-description-logic-output-low = 每当输入出现下降沿时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-air-danger = 危险
signal-port-description-air-danger = 处于危险模式时以 HIGH 调用此端口，否则以 LOW 调用。

signal-port-name-air-warning = 警告
signal-port-description-air-warning = 处于警告模式时以 HIGH 调用此端口，否则以 LOW 调用。

signal-port-name-air-normal = 正常
signal-port-description-air-normal = 处于正常模式时以 HIGH 调用此端口，否则以 LOW 调用。

signal-port-name-decaying = 衰减
signal-port-description-decaying = 绑定的异常开始衰减时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-stabilize = 稳定
signal-port-description-stabilize = 绑定的异常恢复正常时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-growing = 增长
signal-port-description-growing = 绑定的异常开始增长时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-pulse = 脉冲
signal-port-description-pulse = 绑定的异常产生脉冲时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-supercrit = 超临界
signal-port-description-supercrit = 绑定的异常进入超临界状态后爆炸时调用此端口。

signal-port-name-power-charging = 充电
signal-port-description-power-charging = 电池电量增加时以 HIGH 调用此端口，否则以 LOW 调用。

signal-port-name-power-discharging = 放电
signal-port-description-power-discharging = 电池电量减少时以 HIGH 调用此端口，否则以 LOW 调用。

signal-port-name-item-detected = 已检测
signal-port-description-item-detected = 每当发射器检测到物品时调用此端口。
